{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/state/awaiting-promises","title":"Awaiting Promise-based SDKs","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"awaiting-promise-based-sdks","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Awaiting Promise-based SDKs"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"craftAwait"},{"t":"text","text":" when a generator loader needs a browser API, generated client,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or other Promise-based SDK. It works inside "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":", and asynchronous route guards/resolvers."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftAwait, query } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"user"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'user'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"params","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" userId,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"loader","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"params"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"abortSignal"},{"text":" }) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"profile"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAwait","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" sdk.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"readUser","kind":"function"},{"text":"(params, abortSignal));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" profile;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The resolved SDK value keeps its type. Pass either a "},{"t":"code","text":"PromiseLike<T>"},{"t":"text","text":" or a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"factory returning one; a factory starts when the program runs. Plain promises"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"are not iterable, so replace "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* sdk.readUser(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"yield sdk.readUser(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* craftAwait(() => sdk.readUser(...))"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"rejections-and-recovery","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rejections and recovery"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A rejected promise or a synchronous factory throw becomes the typed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_PROMISE_REJECTED"},{"t":"text","text":" exception, with the original error in "},{"t":"code","text":"payload.cause"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The enclosing resource reports "},{"t":"code","text":"status() === 'exception'"},{"t":"text","text":", and exposes the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failure through "},{"t":"code","text":"exception()"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"exceptions().loader.CRAFT_PROMISE_REJECTED"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"It does not require access to an internal technical "},{"t":"code","text":"error"},{"t":"text","text":" member."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Recover locally with a program operator:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { catchTag, CRAFT_PROMISE_REJECTED_CODE, craftAwait } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"profile"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAwait","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" sdk.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"readUser","kind":"function"},{"text":"(userId, abortSignal)).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"catchTag","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"CRAFT_PROMISE_REJECTED_CODE"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" cachedProfile;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Returning a native Promise from a loader remains supported for interoperability."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftAwait"},{"t":"text","text":" provides composition inside a generator and the typed rejection"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"channel shown above."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"cancellation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cancellation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass the loader's "},{"t":"code","text":"abortSignal"},{"t":"text","text":" to an SDK that accepts it. For a producer with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"its own release operation, provide "},{"t":"code","text":"cancel"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"task"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" sdk.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"startRead","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"result"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAwait","kind":"function"},{"text":"(task.promise, { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cancel","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" task.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cancel","kind":"function"},{"text":"() });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"While the program is suspended, its driver invokes "},{"t":"code","text":"cancel"},{"t":"text","text":" when its owning"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"injector is destroyed or its operation is aborted. A query also aborts its old"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"loader when parameters change. A successful await releases the cancellation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"listener without calling "},{"t":"code","text":"cancel"},{"t":"text","text":". The helper does not add retries."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"rejections-and-recovery","text":"Rejections and recovery"},{"level":2,"id":"cancellation","text":"Cancellation"}]}